.firecrawl/

# Internal product constitution — kept on disk for agent work, not published.
# It is 1,783 lines mixing shipped contracts with deferred ideas and roadmap, so
# a visitor cannot tell built from planned. On a site whose entire argument is
# that claims must be evidenced, publishing a spec that reads as claims is the
# largest overclaim risk in the repository. Removed from HEAD at M27; earlier
# commits still contain it, and history is deliberately not rewritten.
ANISH_RUNTIME_MASTER_HANDOFF.md
